gantt
  accTitle: Two tickets in flight
  accDescr: Ticket N+1 starts building when N's draft PR goes to review, gets its own review when N goes into landing, and merges main once N lands; ticket N+2 starts only after N has landed, so never more than two are in flight. Durations are illustrative.
  title Two tickets in flight, never three
  dateFormat HH:mm
  axisFormat %H:%M
  todayMarker off
  section Ticket N
    Build to the push      :n1, 09:00, 60m
    High review and CI     :n2, after n1, 40m
    Fix and low re-check   :n3, after n2, 40m
    Land                   :crit, n4, after n3, 30m
  section Ticket N+1
    Build, disjoint files  :m1, after n1, 80m
    High review            :m2, after m1, 30m
    Merge main, checks     :m3, after n4, 20m
  section Ticket N+2
    Build                  :p1, after n4, 60m
